# Copy to .env. Never commit .env. Testnet only.
# Run "npm run prefund" once: it creates and funds three testnet accounts and writes
# their seeds below. It prints no seed. With all three set, "npm run demo" makes no
# faucet call. Leave any one empty and that wallet comes from the testnet faucet.
HOT_WALLET_SEED=""
MERCHANT_WALLET_SEED=""
DEMO_APPROVER_SEED=""
